; =====================================================================
; Chart of accounts XCL MANAGEMENT CONSULTANCIES - FZCO (IFZA, licence 75707)
; Financial year 1: 15-12-2025 to 31-12-2026. Functional and presentation currency AED, EUR held as foreign currency.
; Basis: accrual, IFRS for SMEs. Regime: Small Business Relief 2026.
; Version 2 (2-11-2026) after the independent review (docs/review_rekeningschema.md).
; Account names in English since 3-11-2026; old Dutch names: docs/account_mapping_nl_en.md.
;
; Currency rule: income, expense and equity accounts in AED only (each posting converted at the CBUAE rate of the day);
; only monetary balance sheet accounts may hold EUR, and they are revalued.
;
; Metadata per account:
;   note:          plain-language explanation (shown on the monthly review list and in reports)
;   vat:           VAT code, linked to a box of the VAT 201 return (explained in docs/chart_of_accounts.md):
;                  zero-rated-export | standard-5 | input-5 | reverse-charge | blocked | exempt |
;                  out-of-scope | zero-rated-purchase | foreign | n/a   (can be overridden per posting)
;   ct:            treatment in the Corporate Tax return: deductible | 50-non-deductible | non-deductible |
;                  arms-length-test (art. 36, connected person) | exempt | interest-art30-31 | n/a
;   related-party: related-party (art. 35) | connected-person (art. 36)   (omitted when not applicable)
;   ifrs:          line in the financial statements
;   rgs:           Dutch RGS reference code for comparability with the Dutch B.V.s;
;                  [v] = still to be verified against the official RGS file
;   rgs-negative:  RGS code to use when the balance changes sign (e.g. receivable becomes payable)
; =====================================================================

